        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/5f9b8f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-29T17:51:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually got two of the upgrade kits just for this reason, so I can have tons of space (and can use the nifty boxes Spiff made which are really helpful to show new players the decks and have them choose their character.With two there is plenty of room for Heroes in one box and environments and villains in the other, I try to keep them separated as much as possible “save it for the showdown” and all.</p>",
