        "id": 34041,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-07-30T06:33:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Rabit&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Rabit\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… Enhanced Edition, Rook City, Ancient Relics (which is currently the “next expansion”), and…</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><em>cough</em> Infernal <em>cough</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-i\"><em>sigh</em></span> That’s what I get for trying to do to many things at the same time…</p>\n<p>Fixed.  8)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Don’t feel too bad, I did the same exact thing a few nights ago. We were talking about Anima and they have an advantage called “Artifact”, which I refered to as “Relic” I then got a puzzeled look. Luckily someone else realized what I meant and corrected it.</p>\n<p>I was thinking about getting an upgrade kit for down the line but they did say they have plans for storage later so I decided to go ahead and wait on that.</p>",
